{last:6,title:"A rose from our first night",text:"For every new beginning: one little rose, saved beneath the first light we found together.",src:"images/gifts/first-light-rose.svg"},
{last:13,title:"A letter across the stars",text:"Some feelings don’t need words to be understood. Sometimes, a quiet glance says everything the heart is too shy to admit, and an unfinished sentence carries more love than a thousand spoken words. There are moments when we feel so deeply that words simply aren’t enough. Under the soft glow of the moon, silence becomes its own kind of language, and even the smallest gestures can hold the deepest emotions. Not every love needs to be confessed, and not every longing needs to be explained. Some feelings are meant to be quietly cherished, held close to the heart, and trusted to find their way to the person they belong to. ❤️🌙 ",src:"images/gifts/space-between-letter.svg"},
{last:20,title:"Our constellation",text:"Seven small stars, joined into one sky that belongs to both of us.",src:"images/gifts/our-sky-constellation.svg"},
{last:24,title:"The queen of our deeper sky",text:"For the bravest round: a little crown, and a promise to keep choosing each other.",src:"images/gifts/deeper-sky-queen.svg"}
