var E={tender:{title:"A gentle forever",q:"Will you keep making our sky with me, one soft and ordinary day at a time? ♡",text:"Since the night we met—May 5, 2026, at 9:00 PM—you have become someone I want to keep choosing. I love your kindness, your laughter, and the way an ordinary moment becomes a memory when you are in it. I do not promise a perfect life. I promise to keep learning you, listening, and building something honest and gentle beside you. I hope we add stars one shared morning at a time."},adventure:{title:"A thousand tomorrows",q:"Will you take the next little adventure with me? ♡",text:"Since the night we met—May 5, 2026, at 9:00 PM—I have wanted to see what the world looks like when we explore it together. I want new places, unexpected turns, brave conversations, and laughter we will remember years later. I cannot promise every road will be easy, but I want to walk it beside you, one curious step at a time."},open:{title:"Keep choosing us",q:"Shall we leave room for every version of the story still to come? ♡",text:"Since the night we met—May 5, 2026, at 9:00 PM—you have become someone I am grateful to know. I do not want to decide every page before we reach it. I want us to keep talking honestly, make room for each other, and keep choosing what feels kind and true. I hope our sky has space for both of us."}};
